  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 609.02 Issuance of Title V Operating Permits. A title V operating permit shall be issued by the department and shall remain in effect until the expiration date, or any suspension or revocation date designated by the department pursuant to RSA 125-C:13.\n\nSource. #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03; ss by #9906, INTERIM, eff 4-26-11, EXPIRES: 10-24-11; ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
